>\t\u2705Hit Call Screen Animations -&gt; ENABLE the design feature<br>\t\ud83d\ude4cEnjoy your phone\u2019s cool new look!<br>\t<br>\t\ud83d\udd90Support<br>\tWe aim to improve our apps, so any thoughts are welcome via the feedback form.<br>\tThrough our app, we empower you to make your phone as wavesome as you.\ud83d\ude0e",
